  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Instructional figure for lesson alg8-c2-s2-n10: closed upper-left quadrant, including its two bounding axis rays and origin. Source cell dimensions, integer phase, source labels and boundary inclusion are retained.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-3695/lemmadeck/ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/8a/figures/fig-23.png",
      "sha256": "ee6c3df6bd43b48df8fa006dbd23478e47ba66fe2dd2d248da7c4699d371ad31"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s2-n10",
        "text": "我们来讨论二元不等式组：\n$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y&\\geqslant x,\\\\x^2+y^2&\\leqslant9.\\end{aligned}\\right.$"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s2-n10",
        "text": "这个不等式组的解集合是其中各不等式的解集合的交集。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s2-n10",
        "text": "我们来看看，以所讨论的不等式组的解为坐标的平面上点的集合是什么。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s2-n10",
        "text": "坐标满足不等式$y\\geqslant x$的点的集合，是直线$y=x$上的点的集合与这条直线上方的开半平面上的点的集合的并集（图22中用水平细线表示）。\n坐标满足不等式$x^2+y^2\\leqslant9$的点的集合，是圆心在坐标原点、半径为3的圆形区域，包含内部和边界（图22中用铅直细线表示）。\n\n一个点的坐标满足这个不等式组，当且仅当这个点属于这两个点集的交集。\n图22中，两种细线重叠的区域就是这两个点集的交集。\n这就是说，所讨论的不等式组给出一个包含内部和边界的半圆形区域。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s2-n10",
        "text": "我们再举两个例子。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s2-n10",
        "text": "例1：考察不等式组：\n$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x&\\leqslant0,\\\\y&\\geqslant0\\end{aligned}\\right.$\n它给出第二象限及其在坐标轴上的边界，包含坐标原点（图23）。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s2-n10",
        "text": "例2：考察不等式组：\n$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y&\\geqslant2x-3,\\\\y&\\leqslant2x+2\\end{aligned}\\right.$\n它给出以直线$y=2x-3$和$y=2x+2$为边界的带形区域，包含两条边界直线（图24）。"
      }
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "fig23-source-grid",
        "description": "Exactly 12 columns by 12 rows, but NOT origin-centered vertically: six cells left/right, eight above and four below. Source bounds [-6,8,6,-4], steps [1,1], offsets [0,0]; origin left/right/above/below [6,6,8,4].",
        "objects": [
          "fig23-frame",
          "fig23-grid"
        ],
        "assertions": [
          "fig23-grid-dimensions",
          "fig23-grid-phase-units",
          "fig23-grid-origin-left-top",
