      },
      {
        "id": "fig23-source-axes-unit-labels",
        "description": "Shared axes, positive-end arrowheads, x/y/0 labels and two first-positive unit labels; y-unit label is to the LEFT of the y axis. Original labels and sides: 0: Immediately southwest of the axes intersection, below x axis and left of y axis. x: Near positive x end, below the axis, to the right of the arrowhead. y: Near positive y end, to the left of the vertical axis. 1: Below x axis at the first coarse grid line right of the origin, x=1. 1: Left of y axis at the first coarse grid line above the origin, y=1; inside the hatched quadrant near its right edge.",
        "objects": [
          "fig23-x-axis",
